Student is class with name and id


For a max-heap (high ID first):
(student1, student2) -> {
    if (student1.id > student2.id) {
        return -1; // Yes: student1 should come first
    }

    if (student1.id < student2.id) {
        return 1;  // No: student2 should come first
    }

    return 0; // Same priority
}
For a min-heap (low ID first):
(student1, student2) -> {
    if (student1.id < student2.id) {
        return -1; // Yes: student1 should come first
    }

    if (student1.id > student2.id) {
        return 1;  // No: student2 should come first
    }

    return 0; // Same priority
}